cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the derived results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Lightweight Networks Match Frozen Foundation Models for Embedded Retinal OCT Layer Segmentation: code and derived results"
abstract: >-
  Code, cross-validation splits and derived per-patient results for a decoder-controlled comparison of frozen
  foundation-model encoders (RETFound, DINOv2) and a fully trained U-Net for retinal OCT layer segmentation
  on OCT5k and Duke Chiu 2015.
